WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.620
¿Cómo lees

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.340
tantos datos

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:01.920
sin perder

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.340
la pista?

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.560
Los sensores

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.260
miden velocidad,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:05.840
temperatura y

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.500
voltaje del

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:06.960
vehículo.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:07.960
El sistema

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:08.800
procesa esas

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.320
señales.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.540
La telemetría

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.800
permite monitorearlas

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.420
a distancia.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:13.280
Pero el

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:13.960
piloto necesita

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.100
información clara.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.020
La pantalla

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:16.640
del volante

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.080
es su

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:17.780
interfaz con

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:18.320
el vehículo.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.240
Muestra lo

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:19.700
esencial:

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:20.700
velocidad,

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.800
batería y

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.280
alertas.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:23.180
Si aparece

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:23.720
un problema,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:24.780
una advertencia

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:25.260
destaca.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:26.280
Así se

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.040
busca reducir

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:27.340
la carga

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.060
mental y

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:28.640
mantener la

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.240
atención en

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:29.620
la pista.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.120
Tecnología y

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.080
reflejos trabajando

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:32.860
como uno

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.160
solo.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.060
Si quieres

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:34.600
saber más

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.580
datos interesantes

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:36.320
síguenos.
